# In-game save / load (from the pause menu): the box window is a 1200 x 800 dialog centred on a 40% scrim (x 360..1560,
# y 140..940): title, the games list, Back at the left of the bottom row, Delete / Save / Load at the right. The
# confirmation boxes are the shared block. MenuButtonFrame holds the buttons, so it is moved over the dialog first.
scrim
window $SaveLoadMenu centre middle 0 0 1200 800 dialog
window $MenuButtonFrame left top 360 140 1200 800
hide $MenuButtonFrame
hide $line

window text:GUI:SelectAGame left top 384 164 800 32 section
rule left top 384 204 1152
window $ListboxGames left top 384 220 1152 600 list

window $ButtonBack left top 384 860 180 44 button
window $ButtonDelete left top 948 860 180 44 danger
window $ButtonSave left top 1152 860 180 44 button
window $ButtonLoad left top 1356 860 180 44 primary

include SaveLoadConfirms.layout
